,"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"淫猥かつ人外の美女、正体は不明……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孤島に迷い込んだ人間達を堕落させる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、島に近寄る人がいなくて暇をもてあましていたが、島に届いた手紙を見て「日本」へ……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11195","sourceWorkId":"14424","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"絶海の孤島の洋館に住む女主人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ありとあらゆるものを魅了し、堕落させる妖悦淫靡な謎の美女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44840"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88d7aa60f1a4e397d128a12d97dd103bf62904c0c2f8c913aa70fbd122a596d8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca69f712c7b190d9f771118e1f3a6ca70d8796bbfff8902e6c353c077b16483e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夕城 粧子","creatorId":"vndb:s4220","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4220","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4220","name":"夕城 粧子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:29543","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4731","characterName":"一柳 あかね","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40333","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25617"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8776"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4731"},"originalCharacterName":"一柳 あかね","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"515"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The closest of childhood friends, Akane was once like a sister to Kyouji. Rarely displaying her femininity outwardly, Akane is oftentimes mistaken as tomboyish, which is especially rooted from her preference to directly take charge of situations she believes are being poorly handled. Akane nonetheless remains popular and sought after by many male students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4731"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が引っ越す前は近所に住んでおり、親同士が仲良かったこともあって兄妹同然に育った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は、勝気でお節介、リーダーシップもある明朗快活でほのぼのとした女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今住んでいる田舎で普通の主婦になってしまうことを恐れており、そうしたことから都会への憧れも強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆の前では、いつも明るく振舞っているが、実は甘えん坊で寂しがり屋さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔から主人公に対し淡い恋心を抱いているようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8776","sourceWorkId":"6467","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恭司の幼なじみ。恭司が引っ越す前は、家が近く、親同士の仲も良かったことから、兄妹のように育った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝気でリーダータイプ、ややおせっかいだが、そのことをまわりが許してしまうほのぼの明朗な人徳を身につけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"決して美人タイプではないが、誰からも好かれる愛嬌と人間味が表情にあふれた素直な少女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40333"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5ffb2bd1dc19666cdbbc1907175deb6779410f77bec910c060dfd748a64eb90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/cac3cbbb19bfdda037b0f5d5e26afc691954a875c90de2bd063e6754dddc2cc2.webp","width":256,"height":128,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116737:40333:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4732","characterName":"双木 葵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40334","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25617"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8777"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4732"},"originalCharacterName":"双木 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"627"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Physically frail and emotionally withdrawn, Aoi seems lost in perpetual deep thought and socially unapproachable. Due to this, relatively few individuals pay heed to her existence, much less acknowledge as a friend. To those cherished people who know better, Aoi is unfailingly devoted and dependable, occasionally surprising them with her quirky yet endearing hidden personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4732"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気でネガティブな女の子。あかねとは幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動が苦手で、勉強自体もあまり好きではない。かといって、劣等生なわけでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は音楽鑑賞だが、その暗い性格とは対照的にヘヴィメタルなど激しい音楽を好む（特に鬱なゴシックメタル）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親と兄が自動車事故（加害者）で他界し、被害者側への賠償で安い借家へ引っ越したことが、彼女をいっそう暗い性格にさせた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自虐的であり、人と関わるのを避けようとするが、無神経なことを平気で口にしてしまう危うさを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく、誰にでも好かれるあかねに密かな嫉妬心がある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8777","sourceWorkId":"6467","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしく、どちらかといえば根暗な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動苦手。勉強は全般的に好きではないが、極端な劣等生というわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目と裏腹に、ヘヴィメタル、特に激しくも欝なゴシックメタル系をよく聴いている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40334"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d12bae73005c08221515109eba25a38db3b2c577d74e47ccc38c1b8b366e1baf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd48404992a8b8837ff0148f31f77c86f8125652efc4ff243c6c69e83e39b23d.webp","width":256,"height":128,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"足立友","creatorId":"vndb:s1165","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1165","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1165","name":"足立 友","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116737:40334:4858:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4733","characterName":"深園 希衣佳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40335","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25617"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8778"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4733"},"originalCharacterName":"深園 希衣佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1005"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of a fabulously wealthy business family, Kiika is an exotic mix of British and Japanese bloodlines. By pure chance and circumstance, Kiika has also returned to Kurehito at the same time as Kyouji, equally overjoyed as him to rekindle their childhood friendship. Kiika exhibits an intense passion for scientific courses, particularly those that apply to astrological fields."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4733"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"社長一家の令嬢。父親は英国人で、彼女はハーフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都会では主人公と同じ学園に通いクラスメイトだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"偶然、親の都合で呉仁町に引っ越してきて、主人公と再会を果たす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗、成績優秀のお嬢様で、学園のマドンナ的存在として祀り上げられてしまうこともしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、彼女も思春期ならではの悩みを抱えており、様々な心の葛藤があるようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8778","sourceWorkId":"6467","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"葵の家のあとに引っ越してきた社長一家の箱入り娘で、父親は英国人のハーフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前、都会にいた時に、恭司とはクラスメイトだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親の都合で呉仁町に引っ越してくるが、偶然にもその後、この地で恭司と再会することになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40335"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f3bc31b770031cc5b5a3c279eb43c092c543f59947b38d5143830c11341bdb3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c3bb670095ded0e310332c056046bc66db19f3fcac5f3477dab9666b7ce1000.webp","width":256,"height":128,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116737:40335:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4734","characterName":"さいたま 闇子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40336","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25617"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8779"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4734"},"originalCharacterName":"さいたま 闇子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1205"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yamiko is the cousin of Kyouji's mother, serving as a legal guardian in place of his parents. She is an accomplished though somewhat obscure occultist, and works as a leading editor of ABRAZE: an underground magazine devoted to revealing legitimate supernatural activity that the government contends does not exist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4734"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"C級アングラオカルト雑誌「ABRAZE」のライターで、主人公の母の従姉妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の両親が渡米したことから、その息子である主人公を引き取って一緒に住まうようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ABRAZE」執筆時のペンネームとして用意した“さいたま闇子”は、本名があまりにも芸名的なため、より珍妙な名前にしようと考えて命名したらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわかした大人の女性だが、自信過剰で、なかなかのやり手。自分の発言を裏付けるための行動力は抜群。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8779","sourceWorkId":"6467","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本名は夢川 姫子（ゆめかわ ひめこ）。C級アングラオカルト雑誌「ABRAZE」のライターで、恭司の母の従姉妹にあたる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲の良かった従姉夫婦が海外に出たことで、息子である恭司をひきとって自称保護者となる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40336"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f76ab65a2832fad2d3cb0b740d9bd7c6db11673bcc3cf4fc5db3f0372f99f63.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11942224b9bcfb373db8b10c89450a73c5e14b3f5ebf0baaa4c399d272a19143.webp","width":256,"height":128,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ひと美","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116737:40336:4675:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4735","characterName":"ユカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40337","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25617"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8780"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4735"},"originalCharacterName":"ユカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious girl with the face of an angel and the soul of a demon, Yuka has a macabre possessive affection towards Kyouji. She appears and vanishes on a whim, bringing more questions than answers with each arrival, eternally seeking approval in his eyes while bitterly condemning anyone else who draws closer to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4735"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達の前に現れた謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも奇怪な猫の被り物と、ピエロのような鉄仮面を付けた怪人物“ゴア・スクリーミング・ショウ”を傍らに従えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無邪気で愛らしい彼女だが、時折浮かべる邪悪な笑みと、残酷な言葉は、その幼い容姿と相俟って不気味さを倍増させる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情の変化がめまぐるしく、躁と鬱の間を激しく行き来しているようにも見えるのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8780","sourceWorkId":"6467","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恭司達の前に度々現れる謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無邪気で人の心をつかむ愛らしさを持つ反面、邪悪な笑みを浮べ、残酷な言葉を投げかける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情の変化がめまぐるしく、躁と鬱の間を激しく行き来しているようにも見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"mask音无紫/mask"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40337"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/498d79a617befc284dcfdcd3facb266f29420ba287e075f40acaa9b066dfef9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b719b979e9880647afec75859e010e9554e59d22222ce72611d991f91370c7e5.webp","width":256,"height":128,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116737:40337:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4737","characterName":"ゴア・スクリーミング・ショウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51346","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25617"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12085"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4737"},"originalCharacterName":"ゴア・スクリーミング・ショウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gore is an entity that transcends all rational concepts, for he is a creature of chaos incarnate, far beyond the comprehension of mortal understanding. Nearly devoid of logical constancy, Gore’s sole anchor of reliability is the unwavering loyalty he exhibits towards Yuka. Taking the physical amalgamation of a cat, clown, devil, and machine, his perpetual madness is united with the deadly combination of sarcastic wit, insulting condescension, sadistic humor, and godlike power."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4737"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユカの傍にひっそりと付き従う謎の怪人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その容姿は、奇怪な猫の被り物と、ピエロのような鉄仮面に血のようなマント。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"会話の端々で不気味な人形を持ち出し、悪意に満ちた一人芝居を演じる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その言動は、異常且つ残虐且つユーモラスであり、理解不能。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12085","sourceWorkId":"6467","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫型の鉄仮面を被り、闇のような黒（または血のような赤）のマントに2メートルもの長身を包んだ異形の怪人。通称ゴア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼の名前はユカが妹と見た映画のタイトルからつけられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調も同じ語句を繰り返すなど、外見以上に奇怪である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にユカの側にいて、時折相手を皮肉った人形劇をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼の正体は作中で明かされることはなかったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マントの中からイカやタコを彷彿とさせる触手が伸びていたことから人間ではないもよう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51346"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92b40053913f624129b917578a616056f097336b148e539b9f235318a4507ae7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47525e75021c9555786a3177f6d4b4c090df4e2c8ce89674735a96b9ca95740f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"黒木大","creatorId":"vndb:s2273","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2273","name":"黒木 大","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116737:51346:27368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36047","characterName":"ケイ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36047"},"originalCharacterName":"ケイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/344bc75c32d52cb33e4edd357a91cb27ccd482f56ebc8e4a79308aa044cd5f52.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a89b36d0c107ee0185657c8c5a20b4483c703e16ce69c210bdabe9e378239ac2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-d